MainMenu: Phantasm
Phantasm: Phantasm Mode
OpenPhanState: Phantasm Mode Enabled
PhantasmOption: "[c/00CCCC:An unofficial special difficulty. Familiarity with Fargo's Souls is recommended.]"
ExpandedFeatures:
	'''
	Sets the world difficulty to Master Mode
	- Retains the original Masochist features
	- Debuff damage will generally not be fatal
	- Reworks some bosses from Masochist Mode to make them more difficult
	- Adjusts some Eternity Mode drops, enchantments, souls, and forces for the new difficulty
	Possible features of this mode include:
	*Lethal projectile spam (from both players and bosses)
	*Explosive numbers and questionable balance
	*Severe frame drops
	You can selectively disable options using the wrench in the lower-right of your inventory, or come yell at me (maybe)
	'''
PhantasmOn: "[c/2FD6FF:Masochist Mode trembles; Phantasm Mode is now enabled.]"
PhantasmOff: "[c/2FD6FF:Phantasm Mode has been disabled.]"
PhantasmFTWWarning: "[c/2FD6FF:Legendary Masochist blooms anew; Legendary Phantasm is enabled. Good luck ^ ^]"
